#: ../../../prop_rule/USES_TERMINAL.rst:2
msgid "USES_TERMINAL"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../prop_rule/USES_TERMINAL.rst:6
msgid ""
"``USES_TERMINAL`` is a boolean which request that the commands produced by "
"the instantiation of the rule will be given direct access to the terminal if "
"possible. With the :ref:`Ninja Generators`, this places the command in the "
"``console`` :prop_gbl:`pool <JOB_POOLS>`."
msgstr ""
